    "detailed_description": "FireFighterWizard is a third-person action-adventure game built around a stylized firefighting. An unseen natural disaster is about to turn the once peaceful fantasy land into a fiery inferno. Try yourself in a role of a firefighting wizard who uses the power of magic to save people, douse burning cities, and traverse treacherous wildlands. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fiery Battles</strong><br>Use your magic and sharp mind in immersive and unpredictable battles against fire forces of nature. <br></li><li><strong>Open World</strong><br>Explore a fantasy land in search of magical items, forgotten trails, and ancient ruins.<br></li><li><strong>Rich Story</strong><br>Talk to inhabitants of the land, search written sources. Learn about the world and look for clues to stop the disaster.<br></li><li><strong>Make Safer World</strong><br>Save people from immediate dangers and clean up the consequences of the disaster.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "FireFighterWizard is a third-person action-adventure game built around a stylized firefighting. An unseen natural disaster is about to turn the once peaceful fantasy land into a fiery inferno. Try yourself in a role of a firefighting wizard who uses the power of magic to save people, douse burning cities, and traverse treacherous wildlands. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fiery Battles</strong><br>Use your magic and sharp mind in immersive and unpredictable battles against fire forces of nature. <br></li><li><strong>Open World</strong><br>Explore a fantasy land in search of magical items, forgotten trails, and ancient ruins.<br></li><li><strong>Rich Story</strong><br>Talk to inhabitants of the land, search written sources. Learn about the world and look for clues to stop the disaster.<br></li><li><strong>Make Safer World</strong><br>Save people from immediate dangers and clean up the consequences of the disaster.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "FFW is a third-person action-adventure game with stylized firefighting. Use the power of magic to douse burning cities and fight fire forces of nature. Explore a fantasy world and find clues to the source of the disaster that turned once peaceful land into a fiery inferno.",
